senses.gloss:
अमुतस्, ind. from there, there; from that place,
from above, i. e. from the other world, from heaven;
hereupon, upon this; henceforth.

अमुथा, ind. thus, in that manner, like that;
अमुथा अस्, to be thus, a euphemistic expression used
in the sense of, to fare very ill.

अमुया, ind., Ved. in that manner, thus or thus;
(with rt. अस् or भू) to be thus; to be gone, to be
lost.

आ-मुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, loosed, let go; liberated;
discharged, cast, shot off; put on as clothes or armour;
dressed, accoutred.
